        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PBSP-135, Scar Plate Used to Correct Poorly Drilled Knob or Deadbolt Installation Holes</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Don-Jo PBSP-135 fits under the rose of a keyed knob or a deadbolt; Scar plates are most often used to correct issues where the hole in the door was not drilled perfectly round or straight. It can also be used to convert a 2-3/8 inch backset to a 2-3/4 inch backset. It has an outer diameter of 3-1/2 inches and an inner diameter of 2-1/8 inches. Choose from satin stainless steel, polished brass, or  dark bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-SP-135-specifications.gif?v=1704354774\" width=\"205\" height=\"254\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PBSP-135 Scar Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deadbolt or Keyed Knob Scar Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outer Diameter: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .030\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
